! A LOST TRAVELLER  (1986)
! II.  The Visibilities
!
! Manuscript for CDGEN.  A. Fredericks, VAXstation II, January 1986.
!
! A seven-eight ostinato for plucked string (2+2+3), four chords of four
! bars each, played three times; the bells are the fringes.
!
TITLE	The Visibilities
TEMPO	84
REVERB	30
SPACE	75
MASTER	120
TAIL	7

VOICE 1 SINE   LEVEL 55 PAN 50 ATTACK 1500 DECAY 0 SUSTAIN 100 RELEASE 3000 GATE 100
VOICE 2 PAD    LEVEL 34 PAN 30 ATTACK 2500 SUSTAIN 85 RELEASE 4000 DETUNE 7
VOICE 3 PAD    LEVEL 30 PAN 70 ATTACK 3000 SUSTAIN 85 RELEASE 4000 DETUNE 9
VOICE 4 PLUCK  LEVEL 60 PAN 40 DAMP 97 RELEASE 300
VOICE 5 BELL   LEVEL 30 PAN 75 RATIO 3.5 INDEX 3.5 DECAY 5000 RELEASE 5000
VOICE 6 FM     LEVEL 22 PAN 60 RATIO 2 INDEX 0.8 ATTACK 3000 DECAY 3000 SUSTAIN 60 RELEASE 3000 GATE 90

! Bass.  Each chord lasts four bars of 7/8: three whole notes and a half.
!	       E                          C#m                           A                             B
PART 1	MP |: E2/1~ E2/1~ E2/1~ E2/2  C#2/1~ C#2/1~ C#2/1~ C#2/2  A1/1~ A1/1~ A1/1~ A1/2  B1/1~ B1/1~ B1/1~ B1/2 :|3
	E2/1~ E2/1~ E2/1~ E2/2

PART 2	P  |: B3/1~ B3/1~ B3/1~ B3/2  C#4/1~ C#4/1~ C#4/1~ C#4/2  C#4/1~ C#4/1~ C#4/1~ C#4/2  D#4/1~ D#4/1~ D#4/1~ D#4/2 :|3
	B3/1~ B3/1~ B3/1~ B3/2
PART 3	P  |: G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/2  G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/2  E4/1~ E4/1~ E4/1~ E4/2  F#4/1~ F#4/1~ F#4/1~ F#4/2 :|3
	G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/2

! The ostinato.
PART 4	MF |:
	|: E3/8 B3 E4 F#4 B3 G#4 B3 :|4
	|: C#3/8 G#3 C#4 D#4 G#3 E4 G#3 :|4
	|: A2/8 E3 A3 B3 E3 C#4 E3 :|4
	|: B2/8 F#3 B3 C#4 F#3 D#4 F#3 :|4
	:|3
	P |: E3/8 B3 E4 F#4 B3 G#4 B3 :|3
	E3/1

! The fringes: from the second time round.
PART 5	|: R/1 :|14
	MP |:	R/1 B5/4 R/4 E6/2 R/1 R/2
		R/1 G#5/2 C#6/4 R/4 R/1 R/2
		R/2 E6/4 C#6/4 R/1 A5/2 R/1
		R/1 F#5/2 D#6/2 R/1 R/2 :|2
	E6/1 R/1

! A high line, the third time only.
PART 6	|: R/1 :|28
	PP B4/1~ B4/1~ B4/1~ B4/2  G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/2
	   A4/1~ A4/1~ A4/1~ A4/2  F#4/1~ F#4/1~ F#4/1~ F#4/2
	   G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/1~ G#4/2
END
